body:
## 📖 About
Yes, this datapack is aimed at completely getting rid of the magic from minecraft by replacing it with logical solutions that are subject to physical laws.
The first step was to remove enchantments and potions, and there will only be more.

### Features:
- Removed all enchantments;
- Removed [advancements](https://minecraft.wiki/w/Advancement) "Enchanter", "Local Brewery", "A Furious Cocktail", "How Did We Get Here?";
- Removed swamp huts;
- Removed recipes for the enchanting table and brewing stand;
- The brewing stand has been removed from temples, basement of igloos and end ships;
- The Silk Touch enchantment has been replaced with a sneak check;
- Enchantments have been removed from all loot tables (to avoid console errors);
  - i.e. there will be unenchanted books everywhere;
- All potions in loot tables have been replaced with bottles of water (duplicates removed);
  - But such effects as: strength, speed, saturation, haste, hunger, blindness, nausea, poison, weakness, wither — are not removed based on the fact that these could have been energy drinks or real poisoning or bleeding;
- Changed [Suspicious Stew](https://minecraft.wiki/w/Suspicious_Stew) recipes to remove unwanted effects.

